## Evidence boundary

No primary source found in this research establishes that a regional maintenance company will pay the proposed white-label prices, grant reusable derived-data rights, or return coded work outcomes. Those are deliberately left as the paid 90-day test. All monetary figures are design arithmetic, not observed market prices.

