+06-scholt	Scholt markets flexibility services for generation, storage and flexible industrial consumption and says its VPP connects assets to energy markets.	https://scholt.com/flex-services-for-energy-assets-scholt-energy	scholt.txt	verified
+06-enervalis	Enervalis' current portal uses the marketing line “Creating more value with energy.”	https://portal.enervalis.com/	enervalis.txt	verified
